WEBVTT

00:00:12.596 --> 00:00:13.973
Oops! Sorry.
抱歉

00:00:16.931 --> 00:00:18.232
(GASPS)

00:00:18.295 --> 00:00:20.636
-(CROWING)
-Ya!

00:00:25.739 --> 00:00:28.602
Hey! Pollito, what's the matter?
宝利特

00:00:28.776 --> 00:00:31.720
-Oh, hey, Eduardo!
-Lucia, I apologize.
你好 爱德华多

00:00:31.885 --> 00:00:34.505
Pollito, he's usually not like this.
抱歉 宝利特平常不这样的

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:39.108
The same thing happened the other day
with Gru, and...
有一次它也是这样对

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:45.915
Oh, well, speaking of Gru, um, have you
seen him? I really need to talk to him.
说到格鲁

00:00:46.018 --> 00:00:48.879
Yes. I think he's somewhere around here.
我觉得他就在这附近

00:00:49.413 --> 00:00:51.066
You two are close, no?
你们俩很亲密吧？

00:00:51.163 --> 00:00:52.466
Oh, I don't know.
我也不清楚

00:00:53.252 --> 00:00:56.112
I mean, "close," I wouldn't say
we were close.
我们也没那么亲密啦

00:00:56.755 --> 00:00:58.278
Why, did he say we were close?
Did he say that?
他亲口说的吗？

00:00:58.372 --> 00:01:00.320
It's more what he didn't say.
他没说过的多了去了

00:01:01.265 --> 00:01:04.174
For instance, he never mentioned
比如说

00:01:04.548 --> 00:01:07.208
that you were both working
for the Anti-Villain League!
你们都在反恶人联盟工作

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:08.934
(GASPS)

00:01:08.969 --> 00:01:10.516
You're coming with me.
你得跟我走

00:01:10.649 --> 00:01:11.812
Hey!

00:01:13.148 --> 00:01:14.648
Crikey!
糟了

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:22.706
So, Eduardo's actually El Macho?
爱德华多真的就是猛爷吗？

00:01:23.001 --> 00:01:24.014
Cool!
厉害！

00:01:24.077 --> 00:01:25.515
No, it is not cool!
不 一点都不厉害

00:01:25.591 --> 00:01:27.953
Plus, I pretty much knew
it was him all along,
我第一眼就看穿他了

00:01:28.146 --> 00:01:30.038
so if anyone's cool, it's me!
所以还是我比较厉害

00:01:30.163 --> 00:01:31.665
(TV BEEPING)

00:01:32.369 --> 00:01:35.074
- Gru!
-Well, Dr. Nefario.
你好啊 尼法里奥博士

00:01:35.419 --> 00:01:37.990
El Macho's onto you.
He knows you're working for the AVL.
他知道你是反恶人联盟的人了

00:01:38.213 --> 00:01:40.013
And he's got your partner.
而且他抓了你的搭档

00:01:40.872 --> 00:01:42.092
Lucy?
露西？

00:01:42.457 --> 00:01:45.470
That's impossible.
She's on her way to Australia!
她去澳大利亚了

00:01:45.734 --> 00:01:47.643
-EDUARDO: Nefario?
-Sorry, gotta go!
抱歉 得走了

00:01:48.515 --> 00:01:49.725
(GASPS)

00:01:50.048 --> 00:01:51.226
He's got Lucy?
他抓了露西？

00:01:52.394 --> 00:01:53.812
Not for long.
抓不了多久的

00:01:54.211 --> 00:01:56.523
Come on, we're getting her out of there.
我们要去把她救出来

00:01:56.982 --> 00:01:58.442
(GROANS)

00:02:49.993 --> 00:02:52.162
(LAUGHING EVILLY)

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:55.082
(MUTTERING)

00:02:59.669 --> 00:03:00.670
(SHRIEKS)

00:03:04.758 --> 00:03:06.426
(CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:03:22.275 --> 00:03:23.819
(MUTTERING)
(GASPS)

00:03:25.195 --> 00:03:26.398
What was that?
什么声音？

00:03:26.483 --> 00:03:27.906
(MUTTERING RESUMES)

00:03:38.291 --> 00:03:39.498
I don't see anything.
什么都没有啊

00:03:39.576 --> 00:03:41.002
(SCREAMS)

00:03:53.223 --> 00:03:54.641
(SHRIEKS) Run!

00:03:55.448 --> 00:03:57.704
-My unicorn!
-MARGO: Agnes, no!
艾格妮丝 快跑

00:04:00.564 --> 00:04:01.648
(SHRIEKS)

00:04:06.945 --> 00:04:07.988
(SCREAMING)

00:04:23.086 --> 00:04:24.129
(BOTH SCREAM)

00:04:31.928 --> 00:04:33.597
Come on! Hurry!
过来 快

00:04:37.132 --> 00:04:38.185
What's the matter?
怎么了？

00:04:38.977 --> 00:04:39.978
(YELLS)

00:04:40.145 --> 00:04:41.480
(BOTH EXCLAIM IN ALARM)

00:04:43.857 --> 00:04:44.900
Bah!

00:04:55.535 --> 00:04:56.578
Ooh là là.

00:04:56.912 --> 00:04:58.788
(CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:04:59.481 --> 00:05:00.624
Kevin!
凯文

00:05:00.749 --> 00:05:01.791
(CHUCKLING)

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:04.836
Dr. Nefario! You're back!
尼法里奥博士 你回来了

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:06.755
In the flesh.
如假包换

00:05:07.797 --> 00:05:09.799
Behold, the antidote.
还带着

00:05:13.573 --> 00:05:17.224
Come on. Let's finally put
this horrible jelly to some good use.
这些烂果冻终于能派上用场了

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:30.070
Ah! Ah!

00:05:30.153 --> 00:05:31.196
(BLOWS RASPBERRY)

00:05:31.321 --> 00:05:32.364
(BOTH CHUCKLE)

00:05:32.531 --> 00:05:35.408
Hey, guys, come on! Stay focused here.
你们俩给我专心点

00:05:35.659 --> 00:05:36.743
(SPEAKING MIONIONESE)

00:05:46.211 --> 00:05:47.254
Huh?

00:05:47.439 --> 00:05:48.881
-(CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)
-Huh?

00:05:52.842 --> 00:05:54.209
Uh... (CHATTERS IN MINIONESE)

00:05:54.484 --> 00:05:56.263
(WILD GROWLING)

00:05:56.418 --> 00:05:57.949
(SPEAKING MINIONESE)
(WILD GROWLING)

00:05:58.133 --> 00:06:00.183
Uh... (IMITATES WILD GROWLING)

00:06:00.767 --> 00:06:01.851
-(BUZZING)
-Oh.

00:06:06.898 --> 00:06:07.983
(WHIMPERS)

00:06:11.778 --> 00:06:13.029
(GULPS)

00:06:13.036 --> 00:06:14.227
Uh, (GROWLS)

00:06:14.573 --> 00:06:15.615
(ORDERS IN MINIONESE)

00:06:17.529 --> 00:06:19.733
Curses! Foiled again!
又栽了

00:06:20.176 --> 00:06:22.284
These guys captured me!
他们俩把我抓住了

00:06:22.597 --> 00:06:23.915
(ALL GROWLING WILDLY)

00:06:50.984 --> 00:06:51.985
(GASPS)

00:06:55.322 --> 00:06:56.406
Uh... (BLOWS RASPBERRY)

00:06:56.489 --> 00:06:57.824
(CHUCKLES) No?

00:06:59.701 --> 00:07:00.744
Bah!

00:07:01.244 --> 00:07:02.370
Run!

00:07:04.205 --> 00:07:05.248
(YELLING)

00:07:11.861 --> 00:07:12.964
Up that tree!
快上树

00:07:14.007 --> 00:07:15.175
Hurry! Hurry!
快 快

00:07:30.148 --> 00:07:31.232
(GRUNTS)

